      <rules>
        <rule id="r79-ih-rule-r41-unit-x-4-shadrak-meduson-legiones-astartes-iron-hands" name="Legiones Astartes (Iron Hands)" hidden="false">
          <description>This model belongs to the X Legion and is affected by rules and effects which refer to Legiones Astartes (Iron Hands).</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="r79-ih-rule-r41-unit-x-4-shadrak-meduson-fury-of-the-survivors" name="Fury of the Survivors" hidden="false">
          <description>Meduson and any Iron Hands unit he has joined have Counter-Attack. When attacking a Traitor unit, Meduson and his unit may re-roll To Hit rolls of 1 in both Shooting and Assault phases.

Counter-Attack: If this unit is not engaged with any enemy models and an enemy unit successfully completes a charge move against it, the unit may take a Leadership test. If passed, this unit gains +1 Attack during the Assault phase.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
